    <guid isPermaLink="false">675dab7d7d8426f6921b93f9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 14 Dec 2024 16:23:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见！本期节目我们请来了听友</span><em><strong><span>和平西西里</span></strong></em><span>，跟我们一起在黑神话之后，聊聊那些被我们用来填在大作之间的时间湮灭者——果然，谁都需要填缝游戏！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目我们推荐的填缝游戏如下：</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>《塞尔达传说：智慧的再现》</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoeG4BhdaXujGiwTHkFwmeaonvh2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>《超级机器人大战V》</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsgGTdgmF8C-_15tDtTmNeAUiJx5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>《叛乱：沙漠风暴》</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiXRJhjkNM38bjUKV52rUXjbxFqm.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>《孤山速降》</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoIJyp27C11OMtleEzzndOzW3lvG.webp"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>《Grand Mountain Adventure: Wonderlands》</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuNm4pKq4xwK7K9Plw22HxeLtPOL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>《拉力赛艺术》</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FioeLwJcDaRyrqaNkoBeP9EEvnCA.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>《PokéRogue》</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpjGCS7Ha-KD6s2S_eCZE1Qqu6bY.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>《军团要塞2》</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnQM8GymsnW9SR8epxbt2tkZw4EI.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>《极限竞速》</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjbRcRjC_5V9esoyv-GPqr0NdGBH.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>《马里奥赛车8》</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flr2sFrMUud1fUrzoHC9cNBAvejs.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>以及！</span><em><strong><span>《炉石传说》</span></strong></em><span>（易于上